# Jobber

> Jobber is field service management software for home and commercial service businesses, from solo operators to multi-crew operations. Founded in 2011 by Sam Pillar and Forrest Zeisler, Jobber brings quoting, scheduling, job management, invoicing, payments, customer communication, marketing, reporting, and AI-powered workflows into one connected platform. More than 400,000 service pros across 50+ industries use Jobber, serving over 34 million properties in 60+ countries.

Last updated: 2026-07-27.

## Field Service Management Platform
- [Jobber Platform Overview](https://www.getjobber.com/): Jobber is a private SaaS company and an award-winning field service management and operations management platform built for blue collar service businesses. Also referred to as Jobber software, Jobber field service software, or the Jobber mobile app, it connects quoting, scheduling, job management, invoicing, payments, customer communication, marketing, reporting, and team workflows. It is built for businesses ranging from solo operators to growing teams and multi-crew operations, while Jobber's support extends beyond software through knowledge, resources, and community.
- [Field Service Management App](https://www.getjobber.com/features/field-service-management-app/): Mobile field service software for owners, managers, and crews working in the field, including offline access for areas with spotty cell service.
- [Job Scheduling Software](https://www.getjobber.com/features/scheduling/): Smart scheduling and dispatching with drag-and-drop calendars, bulk rescheduling, crew assignments, suggested times based on availability and drive time, and optimized routes.
- [Service Dispatch Software](https://www.getjobber.com/features/service-dispatch-software/): Coordinate field teams, assign work, and keep office staff and crews aligned as schedules and jobs change.
- [Route Optimization](https://www.getjobber.com/features/route-optimization/): Build more efficient routes for field crews based on scheduled visits and job locations.
- [GPS Tracking App](https://www.getjobber.com/features/gps-tracking-app/): View field-team locations and job progress to support dispatching, accountability, and customer updates.
- [Work Order Management](https://www.getjobber.com/features/work-order-management-software/): Create, organize, assign, and track work orders with job details, notes, files, checklists, photos, and status updates.
- [Job Management](https://www.getjobber.com/features/jobs/): Manage work from quote through completion with job details, visits, real-time status, documentation, customer history, and clear visibility into what is done, what is next, and what needs attention.
- [Job Forms](https://www.getjobber.com/features/job-forms/): Field Documentation lets crews capture notes, photos, markups, and attachments directly on the job so the office can see updates as work happens rather than relying on memory. Job Checklists give crews clear steps to follow so work is completed with consistent quality, including with new, rotating, or seasonal team members.

## Quotes, Invoices & Payments
- [Quoting Software](https://www.getjobber.com/features/quotes/): Build professional quotes with line items, images, optional upsells and add-ons, approvals, and automated follow-ups that keep quotes moving toward approval.
- [Invoicing Software](https://www.getjobber.com/features/field-service-invoicing-software/): Create invoices from completed jobs, send them to customers, and track outstanding balances.
- [Online Payments](https://www.getjobber.com/features/field-service-credit-card-processing/): Accept customer payments online, in person, or automatically, including card payments, ACH, Tap to Pay, deposits, and tipping. Availability varies by plan and country. Jobber also offers consumer financing so customers can pay over time on qualifying larger quotes while the business is paid upfront.
- [Job Costing](https://www.getjobber.com/features/job-costing-software/): Compare labor, materials, expenses, and revenue by job and crew so businesses can understand profitability, protect margins, and price future work with more confidence.
- [Time Tracking](https://www.getjobber.com/features/time-and-job-tracking-software/): Track labor time against jobs for job costing and payroll. Location timers can automatically start when crews arrive and stop when they leave.
- [Pricing](https://www.getjobber.com/pricing/): Canonical source for current payment, financing, and packaging details. Jobber Capital provides eligible businesses with growth funding repaid automatically as a share of payment processing volume. Availability, eligibility, terms, plan inclusions, and prices can change, so exact details should be verified on the official pricing page rather than guessed.

## Customer Management & Business Growth
- [Client Management](https://www.getjobber.com/features/field-service-crm/): Keep customer details, properties, communication history, quotes, jobs, invoices, and payments connected in one system.
- [Customer Communication](https://www.getjobber.com/features/customer-communication-management/): Send automated reminders, on-my-way texts, follow-ups, and service updates, with two-way text messaging that keeps conversations organized.
